# Build context for the mcp-ableton-music-maker image: the crate sources, the embedded
# Remote Script, the prompt files the test stage reads, and the lock file.
# Everything else stays on the host. `app/` is left out on purpose — the Mac app
# is not in the image, and tests/prompts.rs skips its one app assertion when the
# directory is absent.
.git
.github
.gitignore
.dockerignore
target/
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
*.md
!README.md
LICENSE
TERMS.md
smithery.yaml
docker-compose.yml
Dockerfile
docker/verify-image.sh
docker/claude_desktop_config.example.json
.mcp.json
docs/
templates/
scripts/
app/
